    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d227-a1">

                <pb facs="1277" n="1119" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1119"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to Ambassador
                        Thompson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">November 5,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ambassador</hi>: Referring to your excellency’s
                    courteous note dated May 17 last, I have the honor to transmit herewith a copy
                    of a communication dated <pb facs="1278" n="1120" xml:id="pg1120"/> the 3d
                    instant, addressed to me by the department of government relative to the
                    inspection of meats coming from the United States.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
